        <mxCell id="vMvm5rIfuKM4PlVJf7fk-17" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 [&amp;quot;list&amp;quot;,{&amp;quot;spread&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;start&amp;quot;:1274,&amp;quot;end&amp;quot;:2130},&amp;quot;regular_list_item&amp;quot;,{&amp;quot;start&amp;quot;:1274,&amp;quot;end&amp;quot;:2130},&amp;quot;list&amp;quot;,{&amp;quot;spread&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;start&amp;quot;:1364,&amp;quot;end&amp;quot;:2130},&amp;quot;regular_list_item&amp;quot;,{&amp;quot;start&amp;quot;:1364,&amp;quot;end&amp;quot;:1777},&amp;quot;list&amp;quot;,{&amp;quot;spread&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;start&amp;quot;:1398,&amp;quot;end&amp;quot;:1777},&amp;quot;regular_list_item&amp;quot;,{&amp;quot;start&amp;quot;:1398,&amp;quot;end&amp;quot;:1494}]&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Civilian casualties and collateral damage increase.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 [&amp;quot;list&amp;quot;,{&amp;quot;spread&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;start&amp;quot;:1274,&amp;quot;end&amp;quot;:2130},&amp;quot;regular_list_item&amp;quot;,{&amp;quot;start&amp;quot;:1274,&amp;quot;end&amp;quot;:2130},&amp;quot;list&amp;quot;,{&amp;quot;spread&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;start&amp;quot;:1364,&amp;quot;end&amp;quot;:2130},&amp;quot;regular_list_item&amp;quot;,{&amp;quot;start&amp;quot;:1364,&amp;quot;end&amp;quot;:1777},&amp;quot;list&amp;quot;,{&amp;quot;spread&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;start&amp;quot;:1398,&amp;quot;end&amp;quot;:1777},&amp;quot;regular_list_item&amp;quot;,{&amp;quot;start&amp;quot;:1398,&amp;quot;end&amp;quot;:1494}]&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Russia&#39;s unethical choice at every stage led to various drone attacks on Ukraine&#39;s civilians, one of which includes &quot;human safari&quot;. From 1 July to 9 September 2024, about 5000 drone attacks have been recorded in Kherson, with 30 deaths, (Limaye, 2024)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;[Rule-utilitarianism, rights and duty ethics violated.]&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=9;glass=0;strokeWidth=1;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1">
